          "seconds": 600
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "notes": "Grate the cheese yourself; pre-shredded cheese contains starch that makes the sauce grainy. Add the cheese off the heat so it melts smoothly instead of breaking. Undercooking the pasta lets it absorb sauce in the oven without turning soft.",
